# Testing and debugging

No ESLint script and no e2e suite.

| Command | Where | What it runs |
|---|---|---|
| `npm run build` | repo root | `tsc` in `functions` |
| `npm test` | `functions` | Node test runner: `src/modules/v2/ai-turn.test.ts` only |
| `npm run dev` | repo root | REST plus both WebSocket servers |

Run `npm run build` after a TypeScript change. Run `npm test` in `functions` after an `ai-turn.ts` change. Report the command and the exit code. Do not claim a pass without a run.

## Where bugs usually are

- Reply doubled or skipped: `decideAiTurn`, `activityStart` / `activityEnd`, `userTurnFinal`
- Wrong language or `<ctrl>` tokens: `functions/src/shared/utils/live-transcript.ts` and `INTERVIEW_LANGUAGE_CODES`
- Timer drift: `WRAP_UP_SEC` (120) versus the client window (150) and `syncInterviewTimer`
- Complete returns 412: status is already `completed`
- 401: Bearer token, or the socket `token` query param
- Empty Gemini session: `config/genai` via `firestore-config.service.ts`. `getDefaultLiveModel` throws 503 when unset

Log with `functions/src/shared/logger`. Include `interviewId`. Omit tokens, raw PCM, and API keys. Extend `ai-turn.test.ts` when you change `decideAiTurn`. Do not add a new test runner.
